        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Mwa 9:4; Lawi 7:26-27; l9:26; Kumb 12:16,23; 15:23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kama mtu yeyote wa jumuiya ya Israeli au mgeni anayeishi kati yao anakula damu yoyote, mimi nitamwandama mtu huyo aliyekula damu na kumtenga mbali na watu wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Ebr 9:22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Itakuwa hivyo kwa sababu uhai wa kiumbe umo katika damu. Nimewaagiza kuitolea damu madhabahuni ili kufanya ibada ya upatanisho kwa ajili ya roho zenu; kwa sababu damu hufanya upatanisho maana uhai umo katika damu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiyo maana nimewaagiza Waisraeli hivi: Mtu yeyote miongoni mwenu wala mgeni anayeishi kati yenu kamwe asile damu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mtu yeyote miongoni mwa Waisraeli au mgeni anayekaa miongoni mwao akienda kuwinda mnyama au ndege, ni lazima aimwage damu chini na kuifunika kwa udongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana, uhai wa kila kiumbe umo katika damu. Ndiyo maana nimewaagiza Waisraeli, kamwe wasile damu ya kiumbe chochote kwani uhai wa kiumbe chochote ni damu yake. Yeyote atakayekula damu atatengwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mtu yeyote awe ni mwenyeji au mgeni, anayekula chochote kilichokufa chenyewe au kilichouawa na mnyama wa porini, lazima ayafue mavazi yake na kuoga; naye atakuwa najisi mpaka jioni. Baada ya hapo atakuwa safi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini asipoyafua mavazi yake na kuoga, ni lazima mtu huyo awajibike kwa uovu wake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
